	(text "Project References:\nhttps://digilent.com/reference/programmable-logic/arty-a7/reference-manual\nhttps://digilent.com/reference/_media/programmable-logic/arty-a7/arty-a7-e2-sch.pdf?srsltid=AfmBOoqMg7o7y6b265-ECX5KrBpNABIHgvgwkSd9z3ccQ8Ru-w-2zK3W\nhttps://github.com/snhobbs/scopefun-hardware/tree/master/KiCadSource\n\nAMD Documentation:\nhttps://docs.amd.com/v/u/en-US/ug470_7Series_Config\nhttps://docs.amd.com/v/u/en-US/ds181_Artix_7_Data_Sheet\nhttps://docs.amd.com/r/en-US/ug583-ultrascale-pcb-design/DDR3-SDRAM-Interface-Signal-Description\nhttps://docs.amd.com/r/en-US/ug908-vivado-programming-debugging/JTAG-Cables-and-Devices-Supported-by-hw_server\n\nProject Goals:\n\nRun ML/MPC/LQR on an FPGA\nUse DDR3 to load weights/matrices from an SD card\n\nStackup:\nL1: Signal & Placement\nL2: Ground\nL3: DDR3L\nL4: Ground\nL5: DDR3L\nL6: Ground\nL7: Power\nL8: Signal & Placement"
